            <note corresp="#d477-f3" n="3" xml:id="d477-f3-content">
                <p>In Department telegram 481, May 29, not printed, Under Secretary Clayton
                    answered: “Urtel 416, May 28, having careful attention.” (560.AL/5–2847)</p>
            </note>
